  "description": "A man who owes a loan shark money and resorts to desperate measures to pay off his debt. A doctor who disposes of a body to cover up a crime and scrambles to keep his involvement hidden. A woman who is haunted by her past and seeks revenge against the men who have hurt her. Three very different people with their own reasons for committing terrible crimes, but when their paths intersect in a manner unforeseeable, their actions give rise to unimaginable consequences.\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
